title KubeQuest - start, practice and grade
actor Owner
participant "Browser" as UI
participant Fastify
participant Lab
participant "KVM guest / K3s" as VM
database SQLite
Owner -> UI : Start mission
UI -> Fastify : POST session/start
Fastify -> Fastify : verify owner, origin, mode, maintenance
Fastify -> Lab : start()
Lab -> Lab : enforce single session; fresh overlay
Lab -> VM : boot + apply broken setup
Fastify --> UI : starting session
UI -> Fastify : status polling
Lab --> Fastify : ready
Fastify --> UI : ready status
UI -> Fastify : WebSocket terminal input / YAML apply
Fastify -> VM : pinned SSH / kubectl
VM --> UI : output via backend
Owner -> UI : Check / submit
UI -> Fastify : POST grade with sessionId
Fastify -> Lab : authored checks
Lab -> VM : configuration + behavior probes
VM --> Lab : evidence
Lab --> Fastify : check results
Fastify -> SQLite : store attempt
Fastify --> UI : results and explanations
@enduml
